  title "What the Mask Cannot Say"
  summary "☽'Lucatransiius Glow-bringer, a deceased enforcer of Pactum∴ne, speaks through the mask she once bore to its new carrier, revealing the colony's founding history and her role in it. She describes surveying deep fire-core shafts during a resource crisis, discovering an unexplained cold in shaft eight that she reported as vein depletion to maintain the Accord with the Aurora Stack, a decision that may have allowed corruption to spread beneath the colony's Marker. After setting down the mask at a sanctification rite, it chose Netemia as its next bearer, and Glow-bringer continued serving the colony without the weapon until she made a final stand on the ice against unknown threats, becoming a memorial figure whose sacrifice ensured the colony's survival and the continuation of the Zen∴ctum ceremony."
